/**
 * lychee.css — Sando UI lychee theme: Ref + Sys (light + dark + responsive + surface + inverse ground).
 *
 * DO NOT EDIT DIRECTLY. Generated from the DTCG source under tokens/ via Style Dictionary.
 * Edit the JSON source and run `npm run token:build`.
 *
 * Set `data-brand="lychee"` on <html> to select this theme — every selector here is scoped to it,
 * so on its own this file paints nothing. <html> and not a wrapper, for the same reason data-theme
 * lives there: overlays portal to <body> and the document root is their only common ancestor.
 * Pair it with src/styles/tokens.css (Cmp + type roles), in either import order.
 */

